00:59:15.800 --> 00:59:17.800
or at least it should be informed,

00:59:17.800 --> 00:59:19.800
it's an ongoing project, you know,

00:59:19.800 --> 00:59:21.800
by this Trinitarian

00:59:21.800 --> 00:59:23.800
Christ-like love

00:59:23.800 --> 00:59:25.800
and grace.

00:59:25.800 --> 00:59:27.800
And so I believe that to say,

00:59:27.800 --> 00:59:28.800
as our opening scripture did,

00:59:28.800 --> 00:59:29.800
that Jesus is the way,

00:59:29.800 --> 00:59:31.800
Jesus is the truth,

00:59:31.800 --> 00:59:33.800
you know, he's the life.

00:59:33.800 --> 00:59:34.800
As a Christian,

00:59:34.800 --> 00:59:35.800
really is to say,

00:59:35.800 --> 00:59:38.800
this is who Jesus Christ is.

00:59:38.800 --> 00:59:42.800
His is the story of great love.

00:59:42.800 --> 00:59:43.800
And so by God's grace,

00:59:43.800 --> 00:59:44.800
through the Holy Spirit,

00:59:44.800 --> 00:59:46.800
I long to bring myself

00:59:46.800 --> 00:59:47.800
more and more and more deeply

00:59:47.800 --> 00:59:49.800
into alignment with his ways,

00:59:49.800 --> 00:59:52.800
with that love.

00:59:52.800 --> 00:59:53.800
And this is why I said,

00:59:53.800 --> 00:59:55.800
the truth is that which brings us

00:59:55.800 --> 00:59:56.800
into alignment with the nature

00:59:56.800 --> 00:59:58.800
of reality itself.

00:59:58.800 --> 01:00:01.800
And the way we conceive of reality

01:00:01.800 --> 01:00:04.800
is inevitably, inescapably,

01:00:04.800 --> 01:00:06.800
as a very big story,

01:00:06.800 --> 01:00:08.800
a story which goes all the way

01:00:08.800 --> 01:00:09.800
to the roots of things

01:00:09.800 --> 01:00:10.800
and tells us who we are

01:00:10.800 --> 01:00:11.800
and why we're here,

01:00:11.800 --> 01:00:12.800
what is right, what is wrong,

01:00:12.800 --> 01:00:14.800
and how we ought to live.

01:00:14.800 --> 01:00:15.800
So if you believe

01:00:15.800 --> 01:00:17.800
that the highest human,

01:00:17.800 --> 01:00:18.800
or the highest value

01:00:18.800 --> 01:00:20.800
for human flourishing

01:00:20.800 --> 01:00:23.800
is material wealth and prosperity,

01:00:23.800 --> 01:00:24.800
that's your religious tradition,

01:00:24.800 --> 01:00:26.800
and you will orient your life

01:00:26.800 --> 01:00:27.800
and your family's life

01:00:27.800 --> 01:00:28.800
and those around you,

01:00:28.800 --> 01:00:29.800
you'll try to influence them,

01:00:29.800 --> 01:00:32.800
towards that vision of the good.

01:00:32.800 --> 01:00:33.800
And if you believe

01:00:33.800 --> 01:00:34.800
that the nature of reality

01:00:34.800 --> 01:00:36.800
is a machine,

01:00:36.800 --> 01:00:38.800
then you'll orient your life,

01:00:38.800 --> 01:00:40.800
yourself, and your world to that.

01:00:40.800 --> 01:00:41.800
And if you believe

01:00:41.800 --> 01:00:44.800
the nature of reality is love,

01:00:44.800 --> 01:00:47.800
well then, you'll orient yourself,

01:00:47.800 --> 01:00:48.800
your life,

01:00:48.800 --> 01:00:49.800
the lives of those around you,

01:00:49.800 --> 01:00:50.800
to that.

01:00:50.800 --> 01:00:51.800
So just to kind of summarize,

01:00:51.800 --> 01:00:53.800
I know this has been a lot,

